  {
   "id": "tails-of-iron-ii-whiskers-of-winter-292877@1.14536",
   "gameId": "tails-of-iron-ii-whiskers-of-winter-292877",
   "displayName": "Update 1.14536",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-01-30T17:27:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hey everyone,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First off, a huge thank you to all of you for playing Tails of Iron 2: Whiskers of Winter! Your feedback has been invaluable, and we’re committed to making the game the best experience possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today, we’re rolling out a hotfix that addresses the following issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the game could become unresponsive during the Necromancer Gouraz boss fight on Bloody Whiskers difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where defeating Soldier Grubs with a status effect or Elementa could cause the game to freeze.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the price of the Dull Mole Axe from 0 Coins to 20 Coins.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you’re enjoying the game, we’d love to hear from you! Leaving a Steam review helps us out immensely and lets us know what you think.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ll keep working on more fixes and improvements, so stay tuned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "United Label & Odd Bug Studio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
